      "proposed_content": "The proposed endpoint-boundary account does not qualify as cross-unit synthesis under the assignment gate. Unit u04 alone already derives centered interval counts from differences of log-zeta arguments, constructs the limiting variable as an independent endpoint difference, and obtains the positive, negative, and zero covariance cases from endpoint incidence.",
